pps/2610810/extras/f2210fce606d833c207fcf60055b9233.poster.avif?t=1743592252\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610810/extras/f2210fce606d833c207fcf60055b9233.webm?t=1743592252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610810/extras/f2210fce606d833c207fcf60055b9233.mp4?t=1743592252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your Zoo</strong></h2>As you run your business, you will need to develop it as well. There will be more visitors, which means more attractions that will be able to make their time more pleasant. Take care of the right number of public toilets and sanitary facilities, and eating places where they will be able to eat! Also, don't forget to buy interesting new animals. It is extremely important that guests do not want to leave your zoo and will invite their friends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610810/extras/a3018a4aa654553af10356c3fed3cf51.poster.avif?t=1743592252\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610810/extras/a3018a4aa654553af10356c3fed3cf51.webm?t=1743592252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610810/extras/a3018a4aa654553af10356c3fed3cf51.mp4?t=1743592252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "The Prologue is just part of the gameplay that awaits you in the full version. In Zoo Simulator: Prologue, your main task is to run and manage your own zoo. Renew it and take care of all the animals' needs, ensuring them a peaceful life! Will you attract crowds of visitors? Create your own zoo!",
